      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Opening a new observational window on the high-energy universe through astrophysical neutrinos is a major discovery with lasting scientific reach.",
        "attribution": "Halzen was central to conceiving and building IceCube; Karle played a leading role in its design and operation. Credit must account for the international collaboration.",
        "maturity": "The detection of high-energy astrophysical neutrinos and the emergence of neutrino astronomy are well established, with a growing body of observations.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The long-term scale of discoveries enabled by this new astronomy is still developing.",
          "Attribution within a large collaboration is difficult."
        ]
      }
    },
